{
  "book": "helaman",
  "bookName": "Helaman",
  "chapter": 9,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 541.128,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.598,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, now it came to pass that when Nephi had spoken these words,",
      "verse": "9:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 4.778,
      "end": 8.679,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "certain men who were among them ran to the judgment-seat;",
      "verse": "9:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 8.859,
      "end": 11.274,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even there were five who went,",
      "verse": "9:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 11.454,
      "end": 14.008,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they said among themselves, as they went:",
      "verse": "9:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 14.688,
      "end": 19.239,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, now we will know of a surety whether this man be a prophet",
      "verse": "9:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 19.419,
      "end": 23.552,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and God hath commanded him to prophesy such marvelous things unto us.",
      "verse": "9:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 23.732,
      "end": 26.054,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, we do not believe that he hath;",
      "verse": "9:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 26.234,
      "end": 29.02,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, we do not believe that he is a prophet;",
      "verse": "9:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 29.2,
      "end": 35.934,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, if this thing which he has said concerning the chief judge be true, that he be dead,",
      "verse": "9:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 36.114,
      "end": 40.247,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then will we believe that the other words which he has spoken are true.",
      "verse": "9:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 40.927,
      "end": 44.271,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they ran in their might,",
      "verse": "9:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 44.451,
      "end": 46.959,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and came in unto the judgment-seat;",
      "verse": "9:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 47.139,
      "end": 50.715,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, the chief judge had fallen to the earth",
      "verse": "9:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 50.895,
      "end": 52.381,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did lie in his blood.",
      "verse": "9:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 53.061,
      "end": 55.662,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, when they saw this",
      "verse": "9:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 55.842,
      "end": 60.44,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were astonished exceedingly, insomuch that they fell to the earth;",
      "verse": "9:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 60.62,
      "end": 65.496,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they had not believed the words which Nephi had spoken concerning the chief judge.",
      "verse": "9:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 66.176,
      "end": 68.126,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But now, when they saw they believed,",
      "verse": "9:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 68.306,
      "end": 70.164,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and fear came upon them",
      "verse": "9:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 70.344,
      "end": 75.034,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "lest all the judgments which Nephi had spoken should come upon the people;",
      "verse": "9:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 75.214,
      "end": 78.186,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they did quake, and had fallen to the earth.",
      "verse": "9:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 78.866,
      "end": 81.606,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, immediately when the judge had been murdered\u2014",
      "verse": "9:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 81.786,
      "end": 85.966,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he being stabbed by his brother by a garb of secrecy, and he fled,",
      "verse": "9:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 86.146,
      "end": 90.744,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the servants ran and told the people, raising the cry of murder among them;",
      "verse": "9:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 91.424,
      "end": 96.95,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold the people did gather themselves together unto the place of the judgment-seat\u2014",
      "verse": "9:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 97.13,
      "end": 100.706,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, to their astonishment they saw those five men",
      "verse": "9:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 100.886,
      "end": 102.744,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had fallen to the earth.",
      "verse": "9:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 103.424,
      "end": 107.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, the people knew nothing concerning the multitude",
      "verse": "9:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 107.876,
      "end": 111.08,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had gathered together at the garden of Nephi;",
      "verse": "9:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 111.26,
      "end": 113.768,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they said among themselves:",
      "verse": "9:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 113.948,
      "end": 116.734,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "These men are they who have murdered the judge,",
      "verse": "9:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 116.914,
      "end": 118.818,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and God has smitten them",
      "verse": "9:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 118.998,
      "end": 121.227,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they could not flee from us.",
      "verse": "9:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 121.907,
      "end": 124.879,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they laid hold on them,",
      "verse": "9:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 125.059,
      "end": 127.613,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bound them and cast them into prison.",
      "verse": "9:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 127.793,
      "end": 131.88,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there was a proclamation sent abroad that the judge was slain,",
      "verse": "9:9",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 132.06,
      "end": 136.518,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that the murderers had been taken and were cast into prison.",
      "verse": "9:9",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 137.198,
      "end": 139.659,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that on the morrow",
      "verse": "9:10",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 139.839,
      "end": 143.879,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the people did assemble themselves together to mourn and to fast,",
      "verse": "9:10",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 144.059,
      "end": 147.217,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "at the burial of the great chief judge who had been slain.",
      "verse": "9:10",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 147.897,
      "end": 149.94,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus also those judges",
      "verse": "9:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 150.12,
      "end": 157.504,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who were at the garden of Nephi, and heard his words, were also gathered together at the burial.",
      "verse": "9:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 158.184,
      "end": 161.713,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they inquired among the people, saying:",
      "verse": "9:12",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 161.893,
      "end": 166.816,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Where are the five who were sent to inquire concerning the chief judge",
      "verse": "9:12",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 166.996,
      "end": 168.529,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whether he was dead?",
      "verse": "9:12",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 168.709,
      "end": 170.474,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they answered and said:",
      "verse": "9:12",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 170.654,
      "end": 174.834,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Concerning this five whom ye say ye have sent, we know not;",
      "verse": "9:12",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 175.014,
      "end": 178.125,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but there are five who are the murderers,",
      "verse": "9:12",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 178.305,
      "end": 180.163,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whom we have cast into prison.",
      "verse": "9:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 180.843,
      "end": 185.441,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the judges desired that they should be brought;",
      "verse": "9:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 185.621,
      "end": 187.061,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were brought,",
      "verse": "9:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 187.241,
      "end": 190.213,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold they were the five who were sent;",
      "verse": "9:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 190.393,
      "end": 194.851,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold the judges inquired of them to know concerning the matter,",
      "verse": "9:13",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 195.031,
      "end": 197.957,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they told them all that they had done, saying:",
      "verse": "9:13",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 198.637,
      "end": 201.563,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "We ran and came to the place of the judgment-seat,",
      "verse": "9:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 201.743,
      "end": 208.895,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and when we saw all things even as Nephi had testified, we were astonished insomuch that we fell to the earth;",
      "verse": "9:14",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 209.075,
      "end": 212.233,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and when we were recovered from our astonishment,",
      "verse": "9:14",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 212.413,
      "end": 214.921,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold they cast us into prison.",
      "verse": "9:14",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 215.601,
      "end": 219.27,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, as for the murder of this man, we know not who has done it;",
      "verse": "9:15",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 219.45,
      "end": 221.308,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and only this much we know,",
      "verse": "9:15",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 221.488,
      "end": 224.135,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we ran and came according as ye desired,",
      "verse": "9:15",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 224.315,
      "end": 227.566,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold he was dead, according to the words of Nephi.",
      "verse": "9:15",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 228.246,
      "end": 233.215,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that the judges did expound the matter unto the people,",
      "verse": "9:16",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 233.395,
      "end": 236.089,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did cry out against Nephi, saying:",
      "verse": "9:16",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 236.269,
      "end": 240.959,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, we know that this Nephi must have agreed with some one to slay the judge,",
      "verse": "9:16",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 241.139,
      "end": 243.461,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and then he might declare it unto us,",
      "verse": "9:16",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 243.641,
      "end": 246.149,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might convert us unto his faith,",
      "verse": "9:16",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 246.329,
      "end": 251.159,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might raise himself to be a great man, chosen of God, and a prophet.",
      "verse": "9:16",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 251.839,
      "end": 254.161,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, we will detect this man,",
      "verse": "9:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 254.341,
      "end": 256.709,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he shall confess his fault",
      "verse": "9:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 256.889,
      "end": 260.279,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and make known unto us the true murderer of this judge.",
      "verse": "9:17",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 260.959,
      "end": 265.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the five were liberated on the day of the burial.",
      "verse": "9:18",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 265.876,
      "end": 268.662,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, they did rebuke the judges",
      "verse": "9:18",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 268.842,
      "end": 272.186,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the words which they had spoken against Nephi,",
      "verse": "9:18",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 272.366,
      "end": 278.032,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did contend with them one by one, insomuch that they did confound them.",
      "verse": "9:18",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 278.712,
      "end": 281.963,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, they caused that Nephi should be taken",
      "verse": "9:19",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 282.143,
      "end": 283.258,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bound",
      "verse": "9:19",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 283.438,
      "end": 285.574,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and brought before the multitude,",
      "verse": "9:19",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 285.754,
      "end": 289.051,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they began to question him in divers ways",
      "verse": "9:19",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 289.231,
      "end": 291.135,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might cross him,",
      "verse": "9:19",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 291.315,
      "end": 293.73,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might accuse him to death\u2014",
      "verse": "9:19",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 294.41,
      "end": 295.85,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Saying unto him:",
      "verse": "9:20",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 296.03,
      "end": 297.748,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou art confederate;",
      "verse": "9:20",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 297.928,
      "end": 300.575,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who is this man that hath done this murder?",
      "verse": "9:20",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 300.755,
      "end": 303.634,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now tell us, and acknowledge thy fault; saying,",
      "verse": "9:20",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 303.814,
      "end": 305.393,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold here is money;",
      "verse": "9:20",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 305.573,
      "end": 308.313,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also we will grant unto thee thy life",
      "verse": "9:20",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 308.493,
      "end": 309.933,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if thou wilt tell us",
      "verse": "9:20",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 310.113,
      "end": 313.224,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and acknowledge the agreement which thou hast made with him.",
      "verse": "9:20",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 313.904,
      "end": 315.762,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But Nephi said unto them:",
      "verse": "9:21",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 315.942,
      "end": 318.589,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O ye fools, ye uncircumcised of heart,",
      "verse": "9:21",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 318.769,
      "end": 321.37,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye blind, and ye stiffnecked people,",
      "verse": "9:21",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 321.55,
      "end": 324.197,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "do ye know how long the Lord your God will suffer you",
      "verse": "9:21",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 324.377,
      "end": 327.071,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye shall go on in this your way of sin?",
      "verse": "9:21",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 327.751,
      "end": 335.181,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O ye ought to begin to howl and mourn, because of the great destruction which at this time doth await you,",
      "verse": "9:22",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 335.361,
      "end": 336.894,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except ye shall repent.",
      "verse": "9:22",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 337.574,
      "end": 340.268,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold ye say that I have agreed with a man",
      "verse": "9:23",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 340.448,
      "end": 343.606,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he should murder Seezoram, our chief judge.",
      "verse": "9:23",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 343.786,
      "end": 346.294,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, I say unto you, that this is",
      "verse": "9:23",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 346.474,
      "end": 348.703,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because I have testified unto you",
      "verse": "9:23",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 348.883,
      "end": 351.391,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye might know concerning this thing;",
      "verse": "9:23",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 351.571,
      "end": 354.218,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even for a witness unto you,",
      "verse": "9:23",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 354.398,
      "end": 358.624,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I did know of the wickedness and abominations which are among you.",
      "verse": "9:23",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 359.304,
      "end": 361.301,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And because I have done this,",
      "verse": "9:24",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 361.481,
      "end": 363.989,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye say that I have agreed with a man",
      "verse": "9:24",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 364.169,
      "end": 365.934,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he should do this thing;",
      "verse": "9:24",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 366.114,
      "end": 368.575,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, because I showed unto you this sign",
      "verse": "9:24",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 368.755,
      "end": 372.052,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye are angry with me, and seek to destroy my life.",
      "verse": "9:24",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 372.732,
      "end": 375.89,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, I will show unto you another sign,",
      "verse": "9:25",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 376.07,
      "end": 379.228,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and see if ye will in this thing seek to destroy me.",
      "verse": "9:25",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 379.908,
      "end": 381.533,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold I say unto you:",
      "verse": "9:26",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 381.713,
      "end": 383.478,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Go to the house of Seantum,",
      "verse": "9:26",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 383.658,
      "end": 386.584,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who is the brother of Seezoram, and say unto him\u2014",
      "verse": "9:26",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 387.264,
      "end": 389.447,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Has Nephi, the pretended prophet,",
      "verse": "9:27",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 389.627,
      "end": 398.497,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who doth prophesy so much evil concerning this people, agreed with thee, in the which ye have murdered Seezoram, who is your brother?",
      "verse": "9:27",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 399.177,
      "end": 401.453,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, he shall say unto you, Nay.",
      "verse": "9:28",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 402.133,
      "end": 403.944,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And ye shall say unto him:",
      "verse": "9:29",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 404.124,
      "end": 405.842,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Have ye murdered your brother?",
      "verse": "9:29",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 406.522,
      "end": 410.237,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he shall stand with fear, and wist not what to say.",
      "verse": "9:30",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 410.417,
      "end": 413.157,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, he shall deny unto you;",
      "verse": "9:30",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 413.337,
      "end": 416.123,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he shall make as if he were astonished;",
      "verse": "9:30",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 416.303,
      "end": 419.693,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, he shall declare unto you that he is innocent.",
      "verse": "9:30",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 420.373,
      "end": 422.695,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, ye shall examine him,",
      "verse": "9:31",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 422.875,
      "end": 425.894,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye shall find blood upon the skirts of his cloak.",
      "verse": "9:31",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 426.574,
      "end": 428.385,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when ye have seen this,",
      "verse": "9:32",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 428.565,
      "end": 431.491,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall say: From whence cometh this blood?",
      "verse": "9:32",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 431.671,
      "end": 435.015,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Do we not know that it is the blood of your brother?",
      "verse": "9:32",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 435.695,
      "end": 438.714,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And then shall he tremble, and shall look pale,",
      "verse": "9:33",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 438.894,
      "end": 441.402,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as if death had come upon him.",
      "verse": "9:33",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 442.082,
      "end": 448.259,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And then shall ye say: Because of this fear and this paleness which has come upon your face,",
      "verse": "9:34",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 448.439,
      "end": 450.715,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, we know that thou art guilty.",
      "verse": "9:34",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 451.395,
      "end": 454.135,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And then shall greater fear come upon him;",
      "verse": "9:35",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 454.315,
      "end": 456.683,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and then shall he confess unto you,",
      "verse": "9:35",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 456.863,
      "end": 460.16,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and deny no more that he has done this murder.",
      "verse": "9:35",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 460.84,
      "end": 462.883,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And then shall he say unto you,",
      "verse": "9:36",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 463.063,
      "end": 467.475,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I, Nephi, know nothing concerning the matter",
      "verse": "9:36",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 467.655,
      "end": 470.766,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it were given unto me by the power of God.",
      "verse": "9:36",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 470.946,
      "end": 473.732,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And then shall ye know that I am an honest man,",
      "verse": "9:36",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 473.912,
      "end": 476.559,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that I am sent unto you from God.",
      "verse": "9:36",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 477.239,
      "end": 479.607,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they went",
      "verse": "9:37",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 479.787,
      "end": 483.409,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did, even according as Nephi had said unto them.",
      "verse": "9:37",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 483.589,
      "end": 486.747,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, the words which he had said were true;",
      "verse": "9:37",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 486.927,
      "end": 489.203,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for according to the words he did deny;",
      "verse": "9:37",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 489.383,
      "end": 492.494,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also according to the words he did confess.",
      "verse": "9:37",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 493.174,
      "end": 496.982,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he was brought to prove that he himself was the very murderer,",
      "verse": "9:38",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 497.162,
      "end": 499.809,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that the five were set at liberty,",
      "verse": "9:38",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 499.989,
      "end": 501.522,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also was Nephi.",
      "verse": "9:38",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 502.202,
      "end": 507.218,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there were some of the Nephites who believed on the words of Nephi;",
      "verse": "9:39",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 507.398,
      "end": 512.181,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there were some also, who believed because of the testimony of the five,",
      "verse": "9:39",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 512.361,
      "end": 515.24,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they had been converted while they were in prison.",
      "verse": "9:39",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 515.92,
      "end": 518.335,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now there were some among the people,",
      "verse": "9:40",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 518.515,
      "end": 521.069,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who said that Nephi was a prophet.",
      "verse": "9:40",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 521.749,
      "end": 524.164,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there were others who said:",
      "verse": "9:41",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 524.344,
      "end": 525.83,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, he is a god,",
      "verse": "9:41",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 526.01,
      "end": 527.821,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for except he was a god",
      "verse": "9:41",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 528.001,
      "end": 530.184,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he could not know of all things.",
      "verse": "9:41",
      "lineIndex": 162
    },
    {
      "start": 530.364,
      "end": 533.615,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, he has told us the thoughts of our hearts",
      "verse": "9:41",
      "lineIndex": 163
    },
    {
      "start": 533.795,
      "end": 535.653,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also has told us things;",
      "verse": "9:41",
      "lineIndex": 164
    },
    {
      "start": 535.833,
      "end": 540.477,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and even he has brought unto our knowledge the true murderer of our chief judge.",
      "verse": "9:41",
      "lineIndex": 165
    }
  ]
}